.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Run outputs, evidence, and shipped source snapshots live in artifact storage (tests/test_repository.py is the backstop).
out/
!benchmarks/numerical/tests/bench/data/flock-runs/*/out/
runs/
*.tgz
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.bundle
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.ckpt

# Rust build artifacts anywhere (e958a0b accidentally committed backends/ligero-verify/target, 20.8 MB)
**/target/

# a store fetch's temp file, renamed into place beside its destination (research.store's fixtures and local); a check
# step scanning the tree while another step fetches would count it as a file the tests wrote
.tmp-*

# notes and reports live in ~/.research/notes (AGENTS.md "Where writing goes"); tests/test_repository.py is the backstop
/notes/
**/HANDOFF*.md
**/*HANDOFF*.md
**/*REPORT*.md
**/*URGENT*.md
**/*DRAFT*.md
**/*TRIAGE*.md
**/*STATUS*.md
# generated output (rendered tables, reports, plots, evidence copies, run results) is regenerated from code plus the evidence
# store, or fetched from it by art: id; tests/test_repository.py::test_no_generated_output is the backstop
**/reports/
**/results/
**/results_*.json*
**/renders/
**/previews/
**/plots/
**/evidence/
**/assets/
**/outputs/
*.png
*.pdf
*.html
.bench-cell/

# Lean build outputs (lake)
**/.lake/

